{"id":"8d38c305aa30cc4d","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-overlap.md","title":"规则重叠与变元分离副本","display":"df-overlap — 规则重叠与变元分离副本","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-overlap","aliases":["56-df-overlap"],"display":"df-overlap — 规则重叠与变元分离副本","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-rule]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-subterm]]","[[56-df-mgu]]","[[56-df-variables]]"],"source_section":"§2.7 Lemma 2.7.7","source_printed_pages":"51–52","source_ocr_blocks":[72,73],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-overlap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-overlap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-overlap — 规则重叠与变元分离副本"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98838138a402c043\" href=\"?note=98838138a402c043\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-rule\">56-df-rewrite-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5252b28de1f68970\" href=\"?note=5252b28de1f68970\" title=\"56-df-mgu\">56-df-mgu</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.7 Lemma 2.7.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"51–52"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72</span><span>73</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,T\">\\(\\Sigma,V,T\\)</span> 同 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"98838138a402c043\" href=\"?note=98838138a402c043\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-rule\">56-df-rewrite-rule</a>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 实例化其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_0,\\rho_1\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(\\rho_0,\\rho_1\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l,r,l&#39;,r&#39;,l_0,r_0,l_1,r_1\\in T\">\\(l,r,l&#39;,r&#39;,l_0,r_0,l_1,r_1\\in T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variant}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variant}\\)</span> 的两个项对参数取自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^2\">\\(T^2\\)</span>，不要求它们是合法规则。置换也视为值域在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq T\">\\(V\\subseteq T\\)</span> 内的替换，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>。</li>\n<li>位置和子项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>，最一般合一子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MGU}(s,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{MGU}(s,t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5252b28de1f68970\" href=\"?note=5252b28de1f68970\" title=\"56-df-mgu\">56-df-mgu</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,(l,r),(l&#39;,r&#39;))\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\pi\\in V^V\\;\\bigl(\\pi[V]=V\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in V\\;(\\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\Longrightarrow x=y)\n\\land l&#39;=l\\pi\\land r&#39;=r\\pi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,(l,r),(l&#39;,r&#39;))\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\pi\\in V^V\\;\\bigl(\\pi[V]=V\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in V\\;(\\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\Longrightarrow x=y)\n\\land l&#39;=l\\pi\\land r&#39;=r\\pi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ApartVariants}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1,(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1))\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,(l_0,r_0))\\land\n\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_1,(l_1,r_1))\\land\n(\\mathrm{Var}(l_0)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}(r_0))\\cap(\\mathrm{Var}(l_1)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}(r_1))=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ApartVariants}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1,(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1))\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,(l_0,r_0))\\land\n\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_1,(l_1,r_1))\\land\n(\\mathrm{Var}(l_0)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}(r_0))\\cap(\\mathrm{Var}(l_1)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}(r_1))=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Overlap}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1)\\in T^2\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(l_0)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ApartVariants}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1,(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1))\n\\land l_0|_p\\notin V\\land\\mathrm{MGU}(l_0|_p,l_1)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land(\\rho_0\\neq\\rho_1\\lor p\\neq\\epsilon)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Overlap}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1)\\in T^2\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(l_0)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ApartVariants}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1,(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1))\n\\land l_0|_p\\notin V\\land\\mathrm{MGU}(l_0|_p,l_1)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land(\\rho_0\\neq\\rho_1\\lor p\\neq\\epsilon)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>参数顺序指外规则、内规则；检查“任意两规则有无重叠”时量化所有有序对。剔除同一原规则在根处的平凡自重叠，保留非根自重叠；用原规则身份判定而非改名副本是否相等。可数无限变量集保证有限规则可作变元分离副本。通过最一般合一子表达的存在性与原书共同实例刻画对应；本次核对了Lemma 2.7.7陈述及其引用的非变量子项分类。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-rule","status":"resolved","id":"98838138a402c043","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headi