]，最一般合一子集合 $\\mathrm{MGU}(s,t)$ 见 [[56-df-mgu]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-mgu","status":"resolved","id":"5252b28de1f68970","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"位置和子项见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-subterm]]，最一般合一子集合 $\\mathrm{MGU}(s,t)$ 见 [[56-df-mgu]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,V,T","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_0,\\rho_1\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"l,r,l',r',l_0,r_0,l_1,r_1\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variant}","display":false},{"tex":"T^2","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MGU}(s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,(l,r),(l',r'))\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\pi\\in V^V\\;\\bigl(\\pi[V]=V\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in V\\;(\\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\Longrightarrow x=y)\n\\land l'=l\\pi\\land r'=r\\pi\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ApartVariants}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1,(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1))\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,(l_0,r_0))\\land\n\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_1,(l_1,r_1))\\land\n(\\mathrm{Var}(l_0)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}(r_0))\\cap(\\mathrm{Var}(l_1)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}(r_1))=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Overlap}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1)\\in T^2\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(l_0)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ApartVariants}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1,(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1))\n\\land l_0|_p\\notin V\\land\\mathrm{MGU}(l_0|_p,l_1)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land(\\rho_0\\neq\\rho_1\\lor p\\neq\\epsilon)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2597,"backlinks":[{"id":"4176ebfcf797c869","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\rho_0,\\rho_1\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)$，$s,t,u,v\\in T$，$C\\subseteq T^2$；$\\mathrm{Variant}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]。"},{"id":"00208e314088402a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPBetween}$ 见 [[56-df-critical-pair]]，项对同时改名谓词 $\\mathrm{Variant}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]。$\\mathrm{NF}$ 与 $\\to_P^*$ 分别见 [[56-df-normal-form]]、[[56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive]]。以下辅助函数的规则参数 $P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V))$，$\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)$，$C\\subseteq T^2$，$s,u\\in T$；这些局部参数不限制候选状态 $R,R'$。"},{"id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftLinear}$ 见 [[56-df-left-linear]]，$\\mathrm{Overlap}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-overlap.md]]"},{"id":"4634b959eefaa45b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]] 的正交系统与残余接口。残余保持各式局部取 $a=(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$、$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$、$U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$。红项集与红项位置集的基数式独立对 $s\\in T$ 断言。无重叠与左线性见 [[56-df-overlap]]、[[56-df-left-linear]]，$\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]。"}],"outgoing":["98838138a402c043","6aa7f56f36c897f4","da02033e6d596cae","c3157a722a0edf96","5252b28de1f68970","491e726b9c1f42b0"]}